     <td style="padding-top:0in;text-indent:15.85pt;padding-left:0in;vertical-align:top;padding-bottom:0in;padding-right:0in;"><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="text-indent:0;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:Arial;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:2.935%;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:2.935%;word-break:keep-all;text-indent:0;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#8226;</span><div style="display:inline;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">The Company doesn&#8217;t pay gross-ups for golden parachute excise taxes.</span></div></div></td>
